@baseUrl = http://localhost:5151
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_AUTH_USER_JWT
@workloadToken = REPLACE_WITH_WORKLOAD_JWT_WITH_REQUIRED_SCOPE
@operatorToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_OPERATOR_USER_JWT
@userId = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@profileId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@schoolId = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@invitationId = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@confirmationId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Create own profile. Reuse THIS key and body for a retry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Synthetic","lastName":"User","emailAddress":null,"phoneNumber":null}

### Read own profile and current revision
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Replace contact data at the expected revision
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Synthetic","lastName":"User","emailAddress":"synthetic@example.invalid","phoneNumber":null,"expectedRevision":1}

### Create or reuse global student identifier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/student-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Read own student identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/student-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Create teacher profile using an exact current school invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/teacher-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}","invitationId":"{{invitationId}}"}

### Read own teacher identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/teacher-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Create administrator profile using an exact school invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/administrator-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}","invitationId":"{{invitationId}}"}

### Read own administrator identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/administrator-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Internal status: profiles.status.read workload scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}

### Internal nullable contact: profiles.contact.read workload scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/users/{{userId}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}

### Internal role binding: profiles.binding.read workload scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/profiles/student/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}

### Deactivate: profiles.deactivate workload and active allowlisted operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
X-User-Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":2,"reason":"Synthetic demonstration"}

### Bootstrap: profiles.bootstrap workload and active allowlisted operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/users/{{userId}}/administrator-profile/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
X-User-Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}"}

### MCP delegated read: workload profiles.mcp.write plus independently validated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/delegated/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
X-User-Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### MCP mutation: confirmation must bind EXACT command, operation ID and fingerprint
PUT {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/delegated/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
X-User-Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Synthetic","lastName":"User","emailAddress":null,"phoneNumber":null,"expectedRevision":2,"confirmationId":"{{confirmationId}}"}

### Error example: stale revision, new operation ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Synthetic","lastName":"User","emailAddress":null,"phoneNumber":null,"expectedRevision":999999}

### Error example: invisible or unknown resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/profiles/student/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: own schema and database availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Development OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
